Lumeter (光度计)
Copyright 2026

This product includes software derived from lightstop
(https://github.com/the-waterwheel/lightstop), licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

- Processed-stream luma math: tonemap curve inversion, YUV→linear conversion
  (from ProcessedLumaMath.kt / ProcessedLumaMetadata.kt)
- Robust metering fusion via median statistics (from MeteringFusion.kt)
- Aperture/shutter scale and exposure pairing math (from MeterModels.kt, ExposureMath)
- Metering calibration reference math (from CalibrationMath.kt)
- EV100 conversion from camera exposure metadata (from MeteringAnalysis.kt)

Modifications: rewritten for Jetpack Compose + CameraX, decoupled from manual
Camera2 session management.

